{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB年度盛事《萬千星輝賀台慶》序幕演出陣容強勁！近期爆紅嘅29歲劉穎鏇（Tiffany）企正C位擔大旗領舞。 …</p><p></p>\n<p>TVB年度盛事《萬千星輝賀台慶》序幕演出陣容強勁！近期爆紅嘅29歲劉穎鏇（Tiffany）企正C位擔大旗領舞。入行10年的她由昔日港姐亞軍蛻變成新一代打女，近日在社交平台瘋狂被網民洗版討論，網民大讚：「佢值得紅！」</p>\n<h2>劉穎鏇張振朗為《萬千星輝賀台慶》隧道狂奔</h2>\n<p>今次大騷序幕拍攝安排充滿心思，劇組特別安排劉穎鏇聯同張振朗及劉佩玥站在前排正中間位置擔大旗。三人更首度闖入一條尚未正式通車的隧道內為這場重頭戲上演狂跑戲碼，畫面充滿速度感與視覺震撼力。張振朗亦把握這個難得機會，趁機在未啟用的新路段熟習駕駛環境，整個拍攝過程極具挑戰性。</p>\n<h2>劉穎鏇直言極度渴望接拍全新運動劇</h2>\n<p>在「903籃球賽」一夜爆紅後，劉穎鏇早前接受訪問時大方分享未來事業發展期望。她坦言在公司拍劇多年，心底裡一直盼望能有一套以運動作為核心題材的劇集找她演出，並強調如果能加入籃球元素就最為完美。「因為自己從小到大也是打籃球，覺得運動尤其籃球代表到一種精神，能在球場上展現到有多努力去做一件事。」</p>\n<h2>參選香港小姐苦熬十年憑《隱形戰隊》奪大獎</h2>\n<p>翻查資料，她早於2016年參選香港小姐勇奪亞軍及最上鏡小姐入行，至2023年終奪得《萬千星輝頒獎典禮》飛躍進步女藝員殊榮。過去她曾參演《超能使者》及《隱形戰隊》等高收視話題劇集，獲監製文偉鴻精心塑造出性感打女路線。當時為了完美演繹動作角色，她親身接受地獄式特訓，將體脂率瘋狂降至10%極限狀態。</p>\n<h2>網民力讚：佢有種親和力</h2>\n<p>這次領舞及打籃球片段曝光後，各大社交平台隨即被這股熱潮洗版，大批群眾紛紛留言表達意見。大批忠實支持者力撐Tiffany：「佢不嬲都咁好」、「佢值得紅！」、「佢有種親和力」、「Tiffany d 打戲無得頂」</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179462727719841993_8237553216af7d6cda685d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-1\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179462727719841993_8237553216af7d6cda685d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>TVB年度盛事《萬千星輝賀台慶》序幕演出陣容強勁！（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179462727901758536_663700426af7d6cf702d6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179462727901758536_663700426af7d6cf702d6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>近期爆紅嘅29歲劉穎鏇（Tiffany）企正C位擔大旗領舞。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179462727982066410_5407008416af7d6d01da8f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"photo_6242493416231521821_y_156214365367daaf6d61a2d-1024x576 (1).png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179462727982066410_5407008416af7d6d01da8f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>劉穎鏇於2016年參選香港小姐勇奪亞軍及最上鏡小姐入行。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179462728063549926_2667563216af7d6d105f84.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"itstiffanylau_1474286645_1342736158560166635_193721100_85688635767dab2c45fad8-1024x1279.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179462728063549926_2667563216af7d6d105f84.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>劉穎鏇於2016年參選香港小姐勇奪亞軍及最上鏡小姐入行。（圖片來源：IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179462728229669810_8559563556af7d6d29299c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-4\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179462728229669810_8559563556af7d6d29299c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>劉穎鏇企正C位擔大旗領舞。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179462728352442197_9174668466af7d6d416317.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179462728352442197_9174668466af7d6d416317.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>大批忠實支持者力撐Tiffany：「佢不嬲都咁好」、「佢值得紅！」（圖片來源：IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179462728464183702_10031587606af7d6d4ef02e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179462728464183702_10031587606af7d6d4ef02e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>在「903籃球賽」一夜爆紅後，劉穎鏇早前接受訪問時大方分享未來事業發展期望。她坦言在公司拍劇多年，心底裡一直盼望能有一套以運動作為核心題材的劇集找她演出。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/tvb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">TVB</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%8a%89%e7%a9%8e%e9%8f%87/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">劉穎鏇</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%9c%80%e5%bc%b7body/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">最強Body</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%b1%83%e7%90%83%e5%a5%b3%e7%a5%9e/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">籃球女神</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3542696\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 14 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T05:40:22.863732+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1425,"images":7,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T03:34:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T05:53:59.921346+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T05:33:48.118350+00:00","content_hash":"df569e063cfc5d31f706b6414ab93999b7c948fe6ab20f53f5544882e54a5758","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}